<p. 22a> sṛṣṭiṃ nyāya catuṣkaṃ akulakulagataṃ pañcakañcānya ṣaṭkaṃ |
catvāraḥ paṃcakonyaṃ punarapi caturaṃ ṣoḍaśājñāviśeṣo 
devyāstau mūrttimadhye hasakhaphalakalābindu puṣpākṣamudrā ||

vṛddhaṃ kaumālavālaṃ paramaśivakalācakra devi kramānyā 
śrīnārthaṃ candrapūryyā navanavakalitaṃ yugmabhede tuśāraṃ |
tritatvaṃ siddhāvatāraṃ prathamakaliyuge koṅkaṇe svādhikāraṃ

<p. 22b> teṣāṃ vai putraśiṣyānavapuruṣamate teṣu madhya dviraṣṭau ||

saṃtānaṃ gotrapiṇḍaṃ kulakamasakalaṃ ṣoḍaśāntākramāntaṃ 
ādau dvemaṇḍalāghai paribhimalamalaṃ pūjyasanbhāvavṛndaṃ |
ādhāvasthā daśāntaṃ kulakamasakalaṃ maṇḍalasthānapūrvvaṃ 
saskāraṃ trikṣa me tatpaśujanabhayakṛdvindusiddhī śivāgnau |
madhye viśrāmabhūmi prabhavamanubhayaṃ pratyayaṃ svādhikāraṃ 
saṃsṛṣṭaṃ yena tasmai namata guruvaraṃ bhairavaṃ śrīkujeśaṃ ||

<p. 23a> aiṁ yā sā śakti bhagākhyā tripathagatiyutā trikṣarā triprakārā aiṁ tasyā 
śī(-)oḍiyāne parakalasahitaṃ madhye sasthaṃ sudīptaṃ | 
hrīṁ tacchrīṁ jālaṃdharākhye prakaṭita nilaya dakṣiṇe caiva koṇeśrī 
vāmeśrī pūrṇapīṭhe paśujanabhayakṛtpūjitaṃ yena viśvaṃ || 
hsphreṁ tasyāgre kāmarūpaṃ madanakaliyutaṃ sarvvasiddhālayañca hsauṁ 
trikoṇānte samastaṃ paramaśivakalālaṃ kṛtaṃ yogavṛndaṃ |

<p. 23b> kṣmauṁ tanmadhye divyaliṃga paramasukhakaraṃ binduruṣarūpaṃ 
klīṁ nityānandasvarūpaṃ tadupariparamaṃ ṣaṭprakārairvvibhinnaṃ ||

glūṁ vidyābhogāpagamyamanubhayavimalaṃ triśrapīṭhe lalāṭe 
aiṁ evaṃ vyāptaṃ samastaṃ sthitilayajanī rudraśakti tribhedā |
aiṁ tatrasthā devadevī akulakulamayānanda dhātri svarūpā 
oṃ guvvājñābindubhūtā paśujanaharaṇī siddhi divyogharūpā ||

<p. 24a> hsauṁ nityaṃ klinnā suraktā bhagamudita padānandadhātri prasiddhā 
kṣmoṁ kurvvanti tatvakāmāṃkṣubhitavaratanuṃ śrīkujākhyānnamāmiḥ ||
santānaṃ merumārgeṇa anvayaṃ tatra devatā |
niggamaḥ pīṭha oṃkāraṃ siddhānvaya prakīrttitā |
bhūṣṇībhūti guhāvāsi vṛkṣaścaiva kadambakaḥ |
saṃkhe tasyavitaṃ proktaṃ ambā ca guhavāsinī
saṃgṛhe candrapūraṃ proktaṃ bhedo manthānabhairavaṃ |

<p. 24b> gotra amalikādevī vāmamārgge prakalpayet ||
anvayaṃ pratyayaścāramadhikāraśca koṅgaṇe |
janma brahmaśilāsthāne sthiti śrīkāmarūpake ||
kīrttiściñcini vṛkṣa tu siddhiścaiva tu śāgale |
tuṣṭohaṃ tasya deveśi yojānāti kulākramaṃ ||
ṣoḍaśādhārabhedena nyāsaṃ kuṭaṃ kramaṃ tathā |
pūjitaṃ siddhidaṃ bhadre suśikhyāya nivedayet ||

<p. 25a> namo'stute māhāmāya śūṣmadehe parāpare |
ekākinī viśvadhātmā nādākhe bindumālinī ||
adehāya samutpanne acale viśvadhāriṇī |
mahākuṇḍalani nityaṃ haṃsamadhye vyavasthitā ||
somasūryyāgnimadhyesthe vyomavyāpi parāpare |
oṃkāravigrahāvasthe hakārāddhārddhadhāriṇī ||
bālāgraśatadhā śūkṣme anante cākṣayavyaya |
hakārārddha karādhāre padmakiñjalkamāśrite ||

<p. 25b> sakalākhye mahāmāya varade lokapūjite |
ekaika nādimadhyasthe marmmamekaika bhedinī ||
aṣṭastiṃśatkalādevī bhedinī brahmaraṃdhrake |
vidyullatā nibhādevī bhujaṃga kuṭilākṛti ||
brahmāviṣṇuśca raudraśca iśvaraśca sadāśivaḥ |
ete paṃcamahāpretā pādamūle vyavasthitā ||
trailokyajananīdevī namaste śaktirūpiṇī |
iḍāpiṅgalamadhyasthā mṛṇāratanturūpiṇī ||

<p. 26a> umākhe hṛdgate gaurī dvādaśādityavarccase |
sūnya sūnyāntarāvasthe haṃsākhe prāṇadhāriṇī ||
lambākhye paramādevī dakṣiṇottaragāminī |
nāsāge ca samuttīrṇe madhye sūtra pravāhinī ||
hṛlekha paramānande tālamūrddhni vyavasthitā |
nādaghaṇṭikasaṃghṛṣṭa guṇāṣṭaka samanvite ||
sthūle sūkṣme tva saṃkruddhe dharmmādharmma putadvaye |
kāryyakāraṇakartṛtvaṃ triśūnyanādavigraha | 

<p. 26b> parāpara paraśurddha caitanya śāśvate dhruve |
sarvvavarṇadharīdevī guhyatatva triviśrute ||
śaktimūle mahāvyūhe bindubīja samanvite |
aśarīre mahābhāge saṃsārārṇavatāriṇī ||
jayā ca vijayā caiva jayanti cāparājitā |
tumburubījamadhyasthe namaste pāpamocanī ||
baṃdhamokṣakarī devī ṣoḍaśānte vyavasthitā |
bhramanī śaktiśūlena mahāvyūhe samanvite ||
bhramanī bhrāmanī gaurī māyāmantra pravāhinī |

<p. 27a> svacchandabhairavī devī krodha unmattabhairavī ||
pañcāsavarṇarūpasthā tvayārudrāḥ prakīrttitāḥ |
amṛtākhe ruruścandra namaste jñānabhairavī ||
daṣṭrotkakṭo vidyujihve tālakākṣī bhayānane |
namāmi devadeveśi aghore ghoravikrame ||
jvālāmukhī vegavatī umādevī namostute |
yoginī ca śrayādevī gaurī lakṣmī sarasvatī ||
haṃsasvarādhake devī gomuhī śaktimāriṇī ||

<p. 27b> kroṣṭakī śubhagādevī durggā kātyāyanīstathā ||
nityaṃ klinnā samākhyātā raktā ekākṣarā parā |
brāhmī māheśvarī caiva kaumāri vaiṣṇavī tathā ||
vārāhī caiva māhendrī cāmuṇḍā tvaṃ bhayānanā |
yogeśī tvaṃ hi deveśi kulāṣṭakavibhūṣite ||
aṣṭāṣṭakadharīdevī lakṣmī tvaṃ bahurūpiṇī |
aindrī caiva tu āgneyāṃ yāmyā nai(-)ṛtyavāhiṇī ||
vāyuvyāṃ caiva kauverī iśāne ca mudāhṛtā |
prayāga varuṇā kolā aṭṭahāsa jayantikā ||

<p. 28a> caritre kāmrakaṃ caiva devīkoṭantathākramaṃ |
tathā kāli umādevī devadūtī namostute ||
bhadrakālī mahāmāya carmmamuṇḍā bhayāvahe |
mahośūkṣme mahāśānte namaste śaktirūpiṇī ||
bhurbhuvaḥ svati svāhānte dayānāthaṃ kuru kṣame |
jñānārthitā mahāmāya etaddikṣāmi vedituṃ ||
yastvidaṃ paṭhyate stotraṃ trisaṃdhyā caiva mānavaḥ |
prāpnoti cititāṃ kāmāṃn strīṇāṃ bhavatu vallabhaḥ ||

<p. 28b> [iti śivaśaktisamarasatva mahāmāyā stotraṃ samāptaḥ] ||

piṅgākṣī raktakeśāṃ kiṇi kiṇi dhavaraṃ kiṅkinī mālajālaṃ 
draṣṭrāsyaṃ krulabhāvai sakalabhayaharaṃ pātrahastaṃ ca nādaṃ |
suvyaktaṃ sihanādaṃ lalalalalavalaṃ varvvaraṃ vyomatatva 
bhūtapretādinārthaṃ gahagraṇanamitaṃ kṣetrapālaṃ namāmiḥ ||
raktāmbaraṃ jvalitapiṅgajaṭākalāpaṃ jvālāvali ratirathaḥ |
dadhara pracaṇḍaṃ sūryodayāt kanakakāntanasaṅga

<p. 29a> gaurī gaurīsutaḥ vaṭukanātha mahaṃ namāmi ||

hantārṣākṣotaduḥkhaṃ samita bhavabhayaṃ sarvvavighāntakāya 
gāṁ gīṁ gūṁ gaiṁ khaḍaṅge gagaṇagatigate siddhisarvvārthabhāve |
oṃ hruṁ mudrāgajākṣagasapavanagate ākhuyānekasasthe 
oṃ hrīṁ hraṁ hāṁ gāṁ gaṇeśe dvirada dvikhagaṇe vighnināthaṃ namaste ||
icchājñānikrīyā sāsura varanamitā sāśṛyā maṅgalākhyā

<p. 29b> sā gaurī sā ca durggā bhagavati śubhagā mātṛkā carmmamuṇḍā | 
sā brahmā sā ca viṣṇu grahagaṇasakalā bhairavī kṣetrapālā 
sānekānekarūpā vividhagurudrayā yoginī tvānnamāmi ||
ūkāro nityapādo hasakṣamarabhujovodharaścāgni liṃgaṃ 
vāyuvyāghrājināṃga saśisakalaśirobindunādorddhayukto ||
nijjiṅgagāmbudhārā ṛjuparamakalā bhairavo mantramūrtti 
pāyā devo na vā sakalaguruvaraṃ bhairavaṃ śrīkujeśaṃ ||

<p. 30a> brahmāṇī kamalendu saumyavadaṇī māheśvarī līla
kaumālī ripudarppaṇāsanakali cakrāyudhā vaiṣṇavī |
vārāhī ghaṇaghoragharghanamukhī aindrīśca vajrāyudhā
cāmuṇḍā gaṇanātha bhairagaṇā rakṣantu me mātṛkā ||
śyāmāraktā trinetrā staṇabharaṇamitā mattamātaṅgagāmi
bimboṣṭhī cāranetrā pṛthutarajaghaṇā meṣarā ratnasobhe ||
devāṅge vastaśobhe varavara kusume varvvare keśabhāre

